Electrification on the waterfront: who's buying

A new study puts the average cost of an unplanned day in drydock at over $60,=
000 for a mid-sized workboat.

Repair yards on the East Coast report backlogs stretching into next year, wit=
h labor still the main constraint.

Hybrid propulsion retrofits are moving from pilot projects into fleet program=
s, according to three operators we spoke with.

Events calendar: trade shows, standards meetings and webinars for the coming =
